<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-MARBELLA WORLD SERIES SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARBELLA WORLD SERIES SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARBELLA, Spain 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the Marbella world series men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Bernd Karbacher (Germany) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat 2-Felix Mantilla 7-5 3-6 6-3</p>
</text>
